KNOWNBUG libcxx20
main.cpp
--cpp11 --stdlib libc++
^VERIFICATION
^EXIT=(0|10)$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
std::endl template argument deduction fails on libc++-20.
Cannot be reproduced via preprocessed files because clang -E
preserves built-ins (__remove_cv etc.) that CBMC's internal
preprocessing expands. The failure is in CBMC's internal
preprocessing pipeline when used with libc++-20 headers.
